sequenceDiagram
  actor Shipper
  participant ShipmentService
  participant Shipment
  participant Order
  participant NotificationService

  Note over Shipper: Shipper operates on delivery mobile/web screen

  alt Action: Start Delivery (Pickup)
    Shipper->>ShipmentService: startDelivery(shipmentId, shipperId)
    Note over ShipmentService: Verify shipper assignment and order status WAITING_PICKUP
    ShipmentService->>Order: canStartDelivery()
    Order-->>ShipmentService: true
    ShipmentService->>Shipment: startDelivery()
    ShipmentService->>Order: updateStatus("DELIVERING", shipperId)
    ShipmentService->>NotificationService: publishOrderStatusChanged(orderId, "WAITING_PICKUP", "DELIVERING")
    ShipmentService-->>Shipper: true

  else Action: Confirm Delivered
    Shipper->>ShipmentService: confirmDelivery(shipmentId, shipperId)
    Note over ShipmentService: Verify order status is currently DELIVERING
    ShipmentService->>Order: canConfirmDelivered()
    Order-->>ShipmentService: true
    ShipmentService->>Shipment: confirmDelivered()
    ShipmentService->>Order: updateStatus("DELIVERED", shipperId)
    ShipmentService->>NotificationService: publishOrderStatusChanged(orderId, "DELIVERING", "DELIVERED")
    ShipmentService-->>Shipper: true

  else Action: Report Delivery Issue (e.g. Failed Delivery, Damaged)
    Shipper->>ShipmentService: reportDeliveryIssue(orderId, "FAILED_DELIVERY", notes)
    Note over ShipmentService: Verify order status is DELIVERING (Issue.Report.Status)
    ShipmentService->>ShipmentService: storeIssueAndCountFailedAttempts(orderId)
    ShipmentService->>Order: updateStatus("DELIVERY_FAILED", shipperId)
    ShipmentService->>NotificationService: publishOrderStatusChanged(orderId, "DELIVERING", "DELIVERY_FAILED")
    ShipmentService->>NotificationService: publishIssueReported(issueId, orderId, "FAILED_DELIVERY")
    Note over NotificationService: Always transitions to DELIVERY_FAILED (T5). Admin handles T7 (RETURNING) when failed attempts reach limit (BR-06, UC-07).
    ShipmentService-->>Shipper: issueId
  end
